# Scanner — ai-project-docs

Rule exclusive to this repo. Read `src/scanner/README.md`. Documentation in English.

## Responsibility

Read the **target repository** from disk and produce `RepositoryInfo` + `RepositoryNode` tree. Read-only.

## Outputs

- `repository-loader.ts` → metadata (step 2)
- `repository-scanner.ts` → tree with ignore rules and safety limits (step 3)

## Boundary

Always `RepositoryBoundary` — never read/write outside resolved root. Denied paths: skip, do not force-read.

## Hard stops

- Architectural analysis or module classification — belongs in `src/analyzers/`
- Technology detection — belongs in `src/detectors/`
- Write files in the target repo
- Duplicate directory walks in other modules
